{"about_the_game":"<strong>Try a hard Gang life</strong><br><br>Being in the real Gang isn\u2019t easy. Take your friends and try to rob an Art Gallery or a Bank. You\u2019re not stealing; you\u2019re simply borrowing, whether for a short or long period. You decide. But remember \u2013 take the most precious and run!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/378f1d9d59f02c44fa3f8404cb989c66.poster.avif?t=1752497563\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/378f1d9d59f02c44fa3f8404cb989c66.webm?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/378f1d9d59f02c44fa3f8404cb989c66.mp4?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\u2026or try one day in Police</strong><br><br>It\u2019s even harder to fight the Gangs. You can try, so grab your weapons and create bullet mayhem! Prevent the robberies with your friends \u2013 counterattack the Gangs. Maybe you want to kick someone\u2019s butt with a baton?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/d10cd1e7537ff59d1f620bacbcab585b.poster.avif?t=1752497563\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/d10cd1e7537ff59d1f620bacbcab585b.webm?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/d10cd1e7537ff59d1f620bacbcab585b.mp4?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Enjoy lazy, cozy days at the Police Station</strong><br><br>Don\u2019t let those troublesome Gangs ruin your perfect day! Control the situation in your Town \u2013 answer the emergency calls and protect. Fight back, and make them long for a moment of respite in a windowless room<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/71e567bbfdfdb2d3da29251b23a522cb.poster.avif?t=1752497563\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/71e567bbfdfdb2d3da29251b23a522cb.webm?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/71e567bbfdfdb2d3da29251b23a522cb.mp4?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Real Gangsters wear real stuff</strong><br><br>You are unique, so choose your style, and everyone will recognize you in the Town. No matter if you are on the Gang or Police side.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/9fb537263d4a629b957d235e1399c65e.poster.avif?t=1752497563\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/9fb537263d4a629b957d235e1399c65e.webm?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/extras/9fb537263d4a629b957d235e1399c65e.mp4?t=1752497563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2626830?t=1752497563","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752497563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752497563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam